Argo CD – Git-Ops for Kubernetes :
Deploying applications manually to Kubernetes works until you want consistency, automation, and reliability. That’s where Argo CD comes in picture.

🟦 What is Argo CD?
Argo CD is a Git-Ops continuous delivery tool for Kubernetes. It continuously syncs your Kubernetes cluster with Git. Git becomes the single source of truth.

 What is Git-Ops?
      Git-Ops means:
      1) Kubernetes manifests live in Git
      2) Git defines the desired state
      3) Cluster automatically matches Git state

🧠 How Argo CD works:
       Git Repository -> Argo CD watches Git -> Automatically syncs to K8S

Why Argo CD is used in production:
❌ Manual kubectl apply
❌ Environment drift
❌ Hard rollbacks
✅ Automated deployments
✅ Easy rollbacks
✅ Clear audit trail
✅ Safer & repeatable releases
